    <string name="about_content">
        Micopacks helps managing installed iconpacks on the device.
        Also helps auto applying iconpacks using tasker/locale plugin. Support various launchers and iconpacks.\n\n

        Libraries Used: \n
        ------------------ \n
        RootTools by Stericson \n
        libsu by topjohnwu \n
        Material Components for Android \n
        AndroidX Room \n\n


        Special - Credits: \n
        ---------------------- \n
        preferences-manager by SimonMarquis \n
        Candybar-library by danimahardhika \n\n


        Developed by github.com/ukanth  \n
    </string>

